{meta title='A sequence diagram', about='Participants, numbered messages, dashed replies, an alt frame and a note.'}
{diagram type='sequence', title='Paying an order'}
  participant S as Shop
  participant B as Bank
  autonumber
  S ->> B: Charge 42.00
  alt Enough funds
    B -->> S: Approved
  else Declined
    B -->> S: Refused
  end
  Note over S,B: The card number never reaches the shop
{/diagram}
